    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_8",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Le roi malgré lui (\"King in Spite of Himself\" or \"The reluctant king\") is an opéra-comique in three acts by Emmanuel Chabrier of 1887 with an original libretto by Emile de Najac and Paul Burani. The opera is revived occasionally, but has not yet found a place in repertory.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.9999999949267392,
