    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_10",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Louise is an opera (\"roman musical\" ) in four acts by Gustave Charpentier to an original French libretto by the composer, with some contributions by Saint-Pol-Roux, a symbolist poet and inspiration of the surrealists.",
