    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_9",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Pasquale \"Pascal\" Mazzotti (16 December 1923 in Saint-Étienne-de-Baïgorry – 19 June 2002 in Saint-Ouen-l'Aumône) was a French actor who has appeared in film, television, and theater. He is known for having played a role in \"Hibernatus\" with Louis de Funès, as well as provided the voice of Le roi (The King) in the animated feature film, \"Le Roi et l'oiseau\" (\"The King and the Mockingbird\").",
      "depth": 0,
